3916 0 obj
<</ActualText(This is very memorable to all of us here because of the valuable information )/K[ 4]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3917 0 obj
<</ActualText(that we have received from our special resource person. He has given us more )/K[ 5]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3918 0 obj
<</ActualText(than enough of what expected to know on this important topic. You will agree )/K[ 6]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3919 0 obj
<</ActualText(with me that he deserves our sincere appreciation for sharing with us all the )/K[ 7]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3920 0 obj
<</ActualText(issues that we were yearning for. He has succinctly explained the need to take )/K[ 8]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3921 0 obj
<</ActualText(our learning seriously and the need to observe all the protocols of the COVID )/K[ 9]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3922 0 obj
<</ActualText(19 to reduce the spread of the virus.  His in)/K[ 10]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3923 0 obj
<</ActualText(-)/K[ 11]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3924 0 obj
<</ActualText(depth analysis of this topic will )/K[ 12]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3925 0 obj
<</ActualText(leave with us  long lasting memories. This will go a long way to instil in us the )/K[ 13]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
3926 0 obj
<</ActualText(spirit to learn hard and to observe all the COVID protocols. )/K[ 14]/P 3912 0 R /Pg 1898 0 R /S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
